            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Hear and say the whole form before reading it. Keep ਹੁੰਦਾ (hundaa) whole. This chapter uses it only for one repeated event in the small frame that follows. It does not open the wider habitual agreement system."
            }
